    {
      "id": "claim_ab55aa016c464f85a75a204e9d925583",
      "statement": "The public manifest advertises the narrower MESSAGE_TYPES_PUBLIC list (hello, challenge, verify, friend_request, friend_accept, capabilities, task_request, task_accept, task_progress, task_result, ping, error), omitting hello_ack and the four service_* types; and the server dispatcher only implements handlers for receivable types, so a reply-only type such as hello_ack, verify, capabilities, task_accept or task_progress that reaches a server is answered with a signed error envelope carrying code HAAP_ERROR and detail \"unhandled type\".",
