    {
      "id": "claim_80a28547b07b41cf87fff17cf3b98186",
      "statement": "The envelope security guarantees are exercised end-to-end through the router in tests/test_server.py: tampered signature yields BAD_SIGNATURE, resending the identical envelope yields NONCE_REPLAY, a timestamp 4000 s in the past yields CLOCK_SKEW, a non-bootstrap message from an unknown sender yields BAD_SIGNATURE on the wire, and a bootstrap hello declaring a key whose SHA-256 does not match the claimed fingerprint yields BAD_SIGNATURE.",
