    {
      "id": "claim_af8741ba59b94b92979aca0c9c76b385",
      "statement": "The envelope invariants are non-relaxable protocol constraints: signature covers all fields except signature over deterministic canonical JSON; floats are forbidden anywhere in signed canonical JSON; the ±300 s timestamp window, per-sender nonce anti-replay with 660 s TTL, and the 1 MB payload cap are mandatory; and message_type dispatch is an allowlist that rejects unknown types at parse and sign time.",
